        {
          "text": "Dubbi AABBO Waaqa gula, Musafi Harunifi jaaroleeni gumi Israeli henna balbala gosa Lawi ta Kohathitifi Gershonitifi Merari tolchite. Worri henna kana manafi balbala worra gula tolche. Maqa nama d'iira ch'ufa, ka ganni isaa sodomafi shantama jiddu jiru, ka huji Waaro Woyyuma hojachu dandau, aka arma jalati t'aafani kana gula t'aafani.",
